Package: EpiModelHPC
Version: 2.7.0
Date: 2026-04-17
Title: EpiModel Extensions for High-Performance Computing
Description: Extension package to EpiModel for running batched scenario
    simulations on Slurm-based high-performance computing systems. Provides
    scenario orchestration with 'netsim_scenarios()', 'slurmworkflow' step
    templates for HPC job pipelines, 'swfcalib' calibration helpers, and
    utilities for merging and post-processing simulation output files.
Maintainer: Samuel Jenness <samuel.m.jenness@emory.edu>
